# Review: HiggsfieldPlugin

The plugin matches the spec closely. The connector joins a key id and secret into one
`AccessToken.token` and fails with a typed error when either part is blank. Two GenerationServices
(image and video) share one `HiggsfieldProvider`, contributed with `contributeAll` on
`StudioEvents.Start`; the provider polls the status URL verbatim, retries 5xx, stops on 4xx and on
`failed`/`nsfw`/`canceled`, and times out. Unit tests cover the connector, provider and both services
against mocked fetch. QA-1 has no end-to-end automation: the skipped-by-default live integration test
drives the provider directly, not the studio `Generate` operation.

Of 3 items: 2 done, 0 untested, 1 partial, 0 diverged, 0 missing.

